For SDKs containing multiple independently built packages per version, use
stable package IDs to associate the same package across releases:

```json
{
  "dev": {
    "label": "unstable",
    "packages": {
      "hats": "core",
      "shirt": ["T-Shirt", "new"],
      "pants": ""
    }
  },
  "main"

The collection pattern configuration value is auxiliary to
Collection to auto-set a name to includes without an explicit
name. It takes pairs of regex and template in a dict at *conf.py*, with the syntax:

```python
collection_pattern = {
     "<repo>": {
         "<regex>": "<template>",
     }
}
`
